# Normalize line endings so a Windows checkout cannot break shell scripts,
# workflow files or the byte-exact SHA-256 the docs site pins for its inline
# script.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.woff2 binary
# A file that only ever grows at its end (a log, a changelog kept by hand) makes
# every two open pull requests that add an entry conflict on the same last
# lines. `merge=union` keeps both sides' lines instead. It does not order them:
# use it only where a check or a reader copes with that. For example:
# docs/log.md merge=union
